            owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcChimney> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcStairFlight> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcDoor> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcRamp> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcWall> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcFooting> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcRoof> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcRailing> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcSlab> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcStair> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcRampFlight> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcCovering> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcPile> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcPlate> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcShadingDevice> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcBuildingElementProxy> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcMember> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcWindow> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcColumn> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcBeam> <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcCurtainWall> ) ],
        <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcElement> ;
    owl:disjointWith <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcCivilElement>,
        <https://w3id.org/ifc/IFC4_ADD1#IfcDistributionElement>,
